## 16. Branch Chat Formats

### Fixable

1. Public Main Analysis
2. Internal Validity
3. Duplicate Analysis
4. Select where the task had issues
5. Exact issue checkboxes
6. Detailed issue answer
7. Files changed
8. PR scope changes or `NA`
9. Validation performed
10. Corrected ZIP path
11. Difficulty
12. Senior engineer estimate
13. Comments for Reviewer
14. Initial review time
15. Entire submission time
16. Ready or Not ready

### Invalid/Not Fixable

1–3. Three verdict fields
4. Invalid issue category
5. Environment sub-issue when applicable
6. Detailed unfixable explanation
7. Diagnostics performed
8. Evidence-package contents
9. Evidence ZIP path
10–14. Difficulty, estimate, comments, times
15. Ready or Not ready

### Valid-as-is

1–3. Three verdict fields
4. Confirmation checkbox answers
5. Evidence for each confirmation
6. Validation performed
7. Statement that the task was not modified
8. Statement that no corrected ZIP was created
9–13. Difficulty, estimate, comments, times
14. Ready or Not ready

